Z||000000||California Kid||08-11-2001||09:09 PM||||The pictures are of my old (RIP) Fiero, the stantions were designed by a GM Designer who extended the lower base to raise it about 2 1/2 inches, and move it to the rear of the deck lid. The result really makes the car look good and doesn't change the original attitude of the wing. The part on the car were "quick proto type parts made of laminated paper", which started to come apart over the years, parts were never duplicated.  Just thought I'd share with you.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Bright_Red_GT_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Bright_Red_GT_2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Bright_Red_GT_6.jpg"> ||||reg||1
