Z||000003||California Kid||08-11-2001||09:34 PM||||Just so you don't think I'm crazy for turning a car like this over to the junk hounds!!!  I stripped it of about $2,000 worth of parts before I called them (sorry the spoiler wasn't saved).||||reg||6
